WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.550
Is half of 20 more than a third of 20?

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.280
Half is 10.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.030
A third is not quite 7.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.850
Bigger bottom number, smaller share.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.016
So a half is more than a third.
